    q: 'What is sea freight from China to Saudi Arabia?',
    a: 'Sea freight is ocean container transport from a Chinese origin port to a Saudi destination port such as Jeddah or Dammam. It comes in two forms: FCL (Full Container Load), where you book a whole container, and LCL (Less than Container Load), where your cargo shares a container. It is the default choice for high-volume, non-urgent cargo because the unit cost is lowest.',
